513
00:44:31,413 --> 00:44:32,572
Chefe.

514
00:44:32,655 --> 00:44:34,123
Chefe!

515
00:45:04,689 --> 00:45:06,572
Tudo bem.

516
00:45:09,827 --> 00:45:12,399
